WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:06.077
Tom jumped to his feet.

2
00:00:06.078 --> 00:00:11.145
"So you're awake, Wizard!" Daimon said.

3
00:00:11.146 --> 00:00:14.039
Cat leaped onto Tom's shoulder.

4
00:00:14.040 --> 00:00:16.668
She whispered in his ear.

5
00:00:16.669 --> 00:00:19.457
Daimon had a wicked grin.

6
00:00:19.458 --> 00:00:24.547
"Maybe I'll change you into a mouse," he said.

7
00:00:24.548 --> 00:00:30.843
"Then your pet cat can have fun with you!"

8
00:00:30.844 --> 00:00:33.231
Tom waved his wand.

9
00:00:33.232 --> 00:00:36.656
"Rain!" he whispered nervously.

10
00:00:36.657 --> 00:00:41.775
Poof! Marbles fell from the ceiling.

11
00:00:41.776 --> 00:00:43.851
"Oops," Tom said.

12
00:00:43.852 --> 00:00:47.487
"Ouch!" Daimon cried as marbles hit him.

13
00:00:47.488 --> 00:00:49.291
Daimon jumped out of the way.

14
00:00:49.292 --> 00:00:50.955
He bumped into the tub.

15
00:00:50.956 --> 00:00:53.122
Cat ran between Daimon's feet.

16
00:00:53.123 --> 00:00:54.375
Daimon tripped!

17
00:00:54.376 --> 00:00:57.813
Splash! Daimon fell into the tub.

18
00:00:57.814 --> 00:01:03.007
"Help!" he cried. "I hate water!"

19
00:01:03.008 --> 00:01:09.362
Daimon waved his wand but nothing happened.

20
00:01:09.363 --> 00:01:11.403
Tom looked at Cat.

21
00:01:11.404 --> 00:01:13.223
"You were right.

22
00:01:13.224 --> 00:01:22.015
Water makes Daimon's magic stop working!"

23
00:01:22.016 --> 00:01:27.944
Everyone woke up.

24
00:01:27.945 --> 00:01:33.651
"Good job, Tom!" Ann said.

25
00:01:33.652 --> 00:01:43.883
She waved her wand and tied up Daimon.

26
00:01:43.884 --> 00:01:50.200
Guards brought Daimon to the Grim Dungeon.

27
00:01:50.201 --> 00:01:56.558
They let out the king and Dirk.

28
00:01:56.559 --> 00:02:00.430
"You saved us, Daughter!" Dirk cried.

29
00:02:00.431 --> 00:02:02.174
Ann shook her head.

30
00:02:02.175 --> 00:02:05.294
"It was Tom, Father."

31
00:02:05.295 --> 00:02:07.195
Dirk scowled.

32
00:02:07.196 --> 00:02:10.133
"Thank you, Tom. I guess."

33
00:02:10.134 --> 00:02:14.311
The king was beaming.

34
00:02:14.312 --> 00:02:18.914
"How can I ever thank you, Tom?" said the king.

35
00:02:18.915 --> 00:02:20.369
Tom bowed.

36
00:02:20.370 --> 00:02:23.518
"It's my job, Your Majesty.

37
00:02:23.519 --> 00:02:27.329
I use magic to help people."

38
00:02:27.330 --> 00:02:36.040
Cat purred.

